<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins generally $1.00 higher; butts not fully established; skinned hams steady; seedless bellies 14-16 lbs. 3.00-4.00 higher; fresh lean trimmings not tested. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was very slow, with light demand and offerings.</p>
